WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hear the album play
Playback starts progressively, with ordered tracks and separate performer credits.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
React and see the people behind it
A reaction updates its state; the reactions dialog links to real profiles.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Send from desktop to mobile
Messages are persisted and arrive in the other session live.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Search songs, albums and artists
The same query can be narrowed to each kind of music result.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Queue and navigate without stopping
Queue actions and album/artist links use the same player state.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Give the playlist a cover and share it
Cover upload/removal and visibility are explicit owner controls.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Find artists in common
Cards are derived from listening activity, including the music played during this recording.

8
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Accept from the notification inbox
The live inbox receives the request and resolves it when accepted.

9
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Reply from the phone
The same conversation works with touch-sized controls on mobile.

10
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Listen on a phone
The mobile player keeps progress visible and expands into full listening controls.

11
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Account management
Account emails are redacted; role and deletion prompts are canceled.
